sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Dashboard
    participant ModelArtifact
    participant PredictionModule
    participant AdvisoryRules

    User->>Dashboard: Select city or AQI value
    Dashboard->>ModelArtifact: Load model if available
    Dashboard->>PredictionModule: Send feature row
    PredictionModule-->>Dashboard: Predicted AQI
    Dashboard->>AdvisoryRules: Convert AQI to category/advice
    AdvisoryRules-->>Dashboard: Category, risk level, message
    Dashboard-->>User: Show prediction, trend, advisory

